 ["Which hormone increases water reabsorption in the kidney collecting ducts?","मिर्गौलाको collecting ducts मा पानी पुनःशोषण बढाउने hormone कुन हो?",["Insulin","Thyroxine","Antidiuretic hormone (ADH)","Glucagon"],2,"ADH increases water reabsorption in collecting ducts and helps regulate body water balance.","ADH ले collecting ducts मा पानी पुनःशोषण बढाएर शरीरको पानी सन्तुलन कायम गर्छ।","Urinary system"]
